        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An endless labyrinth, three levels, three floors… and no mistakes allowed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAD SECTOR ³</strong> is a psychological horror game where every room may conceal corruptions you must detect to move forward. Make <strong>three mistakes</strong>, and you’ll be thrown back to the previous floor… forced to start all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through an <strong>unstable structure</strong> that <strong>reshapes itself with every attempt</strong>: rooms shift, turning the path ahead into an unpredictable maze. The mechanical irises will grant you access to the following sectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three levels, each with multiple floors to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An architecture that resets after every trial, ensuring unique runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A progression–regression system that puts your nerves to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three difficulty modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Automatic save system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anomaly log to track your progress and obtain clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam leaderboards and achievements to challenge your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First full run: 2–3 hours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corrupted, the structure cannot repair itself.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It summons you</strong>, twisting your desire to escape <strong>into a tool for its own survival.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An endless labyrinth, three levels, three floors… and no mistakes allowed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAD SECTOR ³</strong> is a psychological horror game where every room may conceal corruptions you must detect to move forward. Make <strong>three mistakes</strong>, and you’ll be thrown back to the previous floor… forced to start all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through an <strong>unstable structure</strong> that <strong>reshapes itself with every attempt</strong>: rooms shift, turning the path ahead into an unpredictable maze. The mechanical irises will grant you access to the following sectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three levels, each with multiple floors to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An architecture that resets after every trial, ensuring unique runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A progression–regression system that puts your nerves to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three difficulty modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Automatic save system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anomaly log to track your progress and obtain clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam leaderboards and achievements to challenge your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First full run: 2–3 hours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corrupted, the structure cannot repair itself.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It summons you</strong>, twisting your desire to escape <strong>into a tool for its own survival.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "The Cube summons you. A sentient structure of many floors where every mistake drags you farther from the exit. Detect the bad sectors, climb through the levels… and try to break the cycle.",
